Why: v0.36.0 waited up to four seconds for a web tree in native apps accepting AXEnhancedUserInterface; require a Chromium-family framework in the addressed process's bundle for that wait, preserving Chromium and Electron first-read readiness.

Each regression has a focused unit test in this patch. No foreground action
is introduced; unknown target facts continue to fail closed.

